 "description": "Based on the award nominated comic book/graphic novel of JEMBER, Etan Comics brings you this Early Reader. Open Hearts Big Dreams, in collaboration with ETAN COMICS, presents the story of JEMBER – the first Ethiopian Superhero as seen on BBC, OkayAfrica &amp;amp; more! Dive into his inspiring story today through this bilingual book designed to help emerging readers build their confidence in reading!",
